tor_replay.E257_25","extraction_not_run_locally","lean_build_not_run_locally","source_bytes_audited"],"id":"lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_sharp_fatal_gap","kind":"declaration","label":"ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_sharp_fatal_gap","locator":"lean/ErdosProblems/Erdos257/PaperCompleteR21/GreedyGapCriteria.lean, line 299","source_id":"lean:ErdosProblems/Erdos257/PaperCompleteR21/GreedyGapCriteria.lean","statement":"theorem paper_sharp_fatal_gap :\n    (∀ k u L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < u → 0 < L → 2 ^ k * u + a = 2 * L + u →\n        (0 < a ↔ (u : ℝ) / (2 * L) < mersenneWeight k)) ∧\n    (∀ k u L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < u → 0 < L → 2 ^ k * u + a = 2 * L + u →\n        (0 < a ↔ ¬ (mersenneWeight k ≤ (u : ℝ) / (2 * L)))) ∧\n    (∀ k u L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < u → 0 < L → 2 ^ k * u + a = 2 * L + u →\n        ((u : ℝ) / (2 * L) ≤ 1 / 2 ^ k ↔ u ≤ a)) ∧\n    (∀ k : ℕ, (1 : ℝ) / 2 ^ k + 1 / (3 * 4 ^ k) + 1 / (7 * 8 ^ k) < mersenneTail k) ∧\n    (∀ k u L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < u → 0 < a → 2 ^ k * u + a = 2 * L + u →\n        2 * u ≤ 3 * a → (u : ℝ) / (2 * L) < mersenneTail k) ∧\n    (∀ u a : ℕ, u ≤ a → 2 * u ≤ 3 * a) ∧\n    ((2 : ℕ) ^ 2 * 7 + 5 = 2 * 13 + 7 ∧ 2 * 7 ≤ 3 * 5 ∧ ¬ (7 ≤ 5) ∧\n      (1 : ℝ) / 2 ^ 2 < (7 : ℝ) / (2 * 13) ∧ (7 : ℝ) / (2 * 13) < mersenneTail 2) ∧\n    (∀ k L : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 2 ^ k * 3 + 2 ≠ 2 * L + 3) ∧\n    (∀ k L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < a → 2 ^ k * 1 + a = 2 * L + 1 →\n        (1 : ℝ) / (2 * L) < mersenneTail k) ∧\n    (∀ k u L a : ℕ, 1 ≤ k → 0 < u → 0 < a → 2 ^ k * u + a = 2 * L + u →\n        mersenneTail k < (u : ℝ) / (2 * L) →\n        3 * a < 2 * u ∧ 2 ≤ u ∧ (Odd u → 3 ≤ u))","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_sharp_fatal_gap","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-sharp-fatal-gap","id":"sha256:57133a32273c3901